{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16092","headline":"早登西禅寺阁 · 王建","name":"早登西禅寺阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上方台殿第三层，朝壁红窗日气凝。\n烟雾开时分远寺，山川晴处见崇陵。\n沙湾漾水图新粉，绿野荒阡晕色缯。\n莫说城南月灯阁，自诸楼看总难胜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16092.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16092","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}